","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"طبع الطفل","images":[]}},{"letter":"D","turkish":{"text":"Çocuğun çevresi","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"محيط الطفل","images":[]}},{"letter":"E","turkish":{"text":"Toplum","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"المجتمع","images":[]}}],"answer":"B","answerUnknown":false,"review":[],"tables":[]},{"id":"okul-oncesi-donemde-duyu-egitimi__2022-23-vize-deneme-sinavi:9","number":9,"turkish":{"text":"Yenidoğan bir bebeğin çevreyi tanıması için kullandığı en temel araç hangisidir?","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"ما الوسيلة الأساسية التي يستخدمها المولود الجديد للتعرف على محيطه؟","images":[]},"choices":[{"letter":"A","turkish":{"text":"Duyular","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الحواس","images":[]}},{"letter":"B","turkish":{"text":"Oyunlar","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الألعاب","images":[]}},{"letter":"C","turkish":{"text":"Duygular","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"العواطف","images":[]}},{"letter":"D","turkish":{"text":"Aileler","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الأسر","images":[]}},{"letter":"E","turkish":{"text":"Akranlar","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الأقران","images":[]}}],"answer":"A","answerUnknown":false,"review":[],"tables":[]},{"id":"okul-oncesi-donemde-duyu-egitimi__2022-23-vize-deneme-sinavi:10","number":10,"turkish":{"text":"Aşağıdakilerden hangisi Dunn’ın ortaya attığı duyusal örüntülerden birisidir?","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"أي مما يلي من الأنماط الحسية التي طرحها Dunn؟","images":[]},"choices":[{"letter":"A","turkish":{"text":"Yüksek algılama","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الإدراك المرتفع","images":[]}},{"letter":"B","turkish":{"text":"Duyusal sorgulama","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الاستقصاء الحسي","images":[]}},{"letter":"C","turkish":{"text":"Duyusal kaçınma","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"التجنب الحسي","images":[]}},{"letter":"D","turkish":{"text":"Duyusal yoksunluk","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الحرمان الحسي","images":[]}},{"letter":"E","turkish":{"text":"Duyusal yatkınlık","images":[]},"arabic":{"text":"الاستعداد الحسي","i